            "value" : "Actions supplémentaires"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The `UnauthorizedError` is handled by destroying the whole view when it happens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’erreur `UnauthorizedError` est gérée par la destruction de la vue où elle survient."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There should be as many ➡️ as ⬅️ after errors have been handled by the user, unless an error is discarded, in which case no action is executed and there is no ⬅️." : {

    },
    "This demo application reviews frequent use cases of error handling." : {
